From eb3542cffa4df3ba0baf813ffd53a21e3c11911d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:57:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix candle chart display issues in grid view by adding
 WebSocket kline streaming and improving cache logic

*   **crypto-screener/app/collector.py**:
    *   Implemented `watch_candles` method to establish persistent WebSocket subscriptions for K-lines specifically for the charts grid, ensuring data continuity during focus mode pauses.
    *   Added `_candle_stream` task handler to receive real-time OHLCV updates from exchanges via `watch_ohlcv_for_symbols`, writing to a dedicated `grid_ohlcv` buffer to avoid corrupting 1m screener metrics.
    *   Introduced `_resubscribe_grid` in `CollectorHub` to manage concurrent WebSocket subscription races, preventing "already subscribed" errors when the grid composition changes frequently.
    *   Enhanced `fetch_candles` and `_fresh_candles_from_store` to prioritize live WS buffers and implement stale-cache fallbacks, reducing timeouts when REST queues are congested.
    *   Updated `_close_streams` and rotation logic to preserve K-line streams (`keep_candles`) for active grid symbols even when other exchange streams are paused or rotated.
---
 crypto-screener/app/collector.py | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 crypto-screener/web/app.js       | 23 +++++++++-
 2 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

